          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners argue that judges serving on the Court of Military Commission Review hold a second, military office, which they say violates the dual\u2011office\u2011holding prohibition in 28\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f973(b)."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
